- in work performed for clients; and
- alongside your own tools, Project Content and Extensions.

This permission applies only to use of the Official Package. It does not give
you permission to sell, license, host, distribute or otherwise offer EWAI
itself, whether alone or as part of another product or service.

3. Your Project Content and Output

Backstory Group claims no ownership of your Project Content or Output merely
